<title>USA: Transcontinental Realty has no comment on activity.</title>
<headline>Transcontinental Realty has no comment on activity.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transcontinental Realty Investors Inc said Monday it would not comment on recent unusual trading activity involving its stock.</p>
<p>&quot;It is the company's policy not to comment on variances in the trading or price of the company's stock,&quot; it said in a statement after being contacted by the New York Stock Exchange about the matter.</p>
<p>Transcontinental Realty is a nationwide real estate investment company.</p>
<p>In afternoon trading, the stock was up three at 20-3/4.</p>
</text>
